\cf2 \cb5 That's a future optimization problem, rather than an immediate reason to avoid Kick. At that point, you could compare actual multistream earnings against the potential earnings from occasional Kick-exclusive broadcasts.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 Kick's VOD retention is much shorter than YouTube's.
\f0\b0  Non-verified Kick channels retain replays for seven days; verified channels can retain them for thirty days. There are also limits on how many VODs may be stored. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

