\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 YouTube has announced tougher requirements for entering its full advertising program starting February 1, 2027.
\f0\b0  New applicants will need 8,000 qualified annual watch hours or 20 million qualified Shorts views, alongside 1,000 subscribers. The earlier 500-subscriber fan-funding eligibility thresholds are not changing. \cf0 \cb1 \
