\f4\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <$Scr_H::2>
\f5\b\fs48 2. What Kick is known for culturally\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0\fs28 Kick launched in late 2022 as a direct competitor to Twitch. Its selling points included substantially more favorable subscription revenue sharing, greater tolerance for controversial personalities, and an emphasis on less filtered entertainment.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Its founders have ties to the gambling company Stake, and gambling-related content has played a significant role in its identity. Kick has also recruited established streamers such as xQc and Adin Ross. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

