\cf2 \cb5 Broadly speaking, Kick's most visible culture features:\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Personality and IRL entertainment:
\f0\b0  Long conversational broadcasts, social interactions, reactions, lifestyle events, and high-energy personalities.\cf0 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Provocative humor:
\f0\b0  Edgy language, teasing, internet memes, and a tendency toward deliberately outrageous material.\cf0 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Strong live participation:
\f0\b0  Fast-moving chat, emotes, gifted subscriptions, viewer challenges, and frequent interaction with the host.\cf0 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Controversy:
\f0\b0  Some major creators have attracted audiences through conflict, stunts, and confrontational behavior.\cf0 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 \strokec2 That last point deserves some context.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Kick's permissive reputation is not entirely imaginary. Following the death of French streamer Jean Pormanove during a broadcast in August 2025, the platform faced substantial scrutiny over its handling of broadcasts featuring abuse and humiliation. Kick subsequently removed the channel and banned participants. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

