\f4\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f0\fs28 I found an illuminating December 2025 discussion in r/Twitch from a creator who started multistreaming to Kick and noticed more trolling.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Responses were mixed, although strongly skewed toward describing Kick as edgier and more hostile.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 One creator reported encountering virtually no actual trolls, just a large amount of bot spam. Another reported a relatively pleasant experience in a smaller VTuber community. Several others described racism, aggressive trolling, and generally unpleasant interactions. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

