\f0\fs28 The part that fascinates me most is your phrase 
\f1\i "interstitial fill-in."
\f0\i0 \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Suppose an AI system in the future has access to:\cf0 \cb1 \
